	(text "- U6 TCAN1044AV (+-58 V bus fault, 3V3 VIO) on ESP32 TWAI. CAN is the only bus, no RS-485\n- L1 common-mode choke footprint, 0R-bridgeable\n- SJ2 split termination 2 x 60R + 4.7 nF, closed only at the end of the chain\n- ESD diode on CANH / CANL. Daisy chain J1(top) -> ribbons -> J1(bottom), no stubs\n- 500 kbps default. Slot schedule via periodic CAN SYNC frame from the top rail\n- Test points CANH, CANL + GND"
